# Phase 02 — Schema & RLS

## Goal

Ship the v1 Postgres schema with invariants, RLS, gym provisioning, demo seed data, and cross-tenant pgTAP coverage.

## Tasks

- Migrations for: `gyms`, `user_profiles`, `user_gym_roles`, `members`, `membership_plans`, `member_subscriptions`, `payments`, `attendance_records`, `audit_logs`.
- Same-gym invariants, amount constraints, append-only payments.
- RLS on every table via security-definer role helper.
- `provision_gym` function (service-role-only) plus one-time script.
- Dev seed with two demo gyms.
- pgTAP tests for cross-tenant read/insert/update/delete.

## Done when

- [ ] All listed tables migrated with invariants
- [ ] RLS policies in place; no client inserts into `gyms` / `user_gym_roles`
- [ ] `provision_gym` + one-time script work
- [ ] Two-gym seed loads
- [ ] pgTAP cross-tenant tests pass
